#  Dear collegue,
# these are the data of our fit. 
# As claimed in the paper our interest was only on the determination of the 
# most faithful analytical description of the data. Since the decomposition 
# in resonant and continuum contributions is applied on the X-section and not 
# on the amplitude, the resonance parameters are very uncertain. Only the 
# statistical errors have been considered.
# 
#  
#  Best regards              Danilo Babusci
#
#
